OL,3,GNEWSAHeat network to receive #9m
OL,4,Agovernment grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital, several schools and
OL,7,Fhundreds of homes are set to benefit
OL,8,Ffrom a #9m expansion of a new clean
OL,9,Fheat network in West Yorkshire.
OL,11,FFor the past few years work has been
OL,12,Funderway to develop a low carbon heat
OL,13,Fnetwork in Bradford city centre and the
OL,14,Fgovernment announced the extra funding
OL,15,Fon Tuesday.
OL,17,FBuildings to benefit from lower bills
OL,18,Fand cleaner heating include St Luke's
OL,19,FHospital, 255 homes and seven schools
OL,20,Fand colleges, said the Department for
OL,21,FEnergy Security and Net Zero (DESNZ).
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
